      "transcript_text": "It's on and off. I notice it more with lying down and caffeine. Maybe a five out of ten on a bad day. I get some relief from deep breaths. Right, I've also had a flutter in my chest, for about three months. Let me think, I had being a bit anxious before. That's settled now, though.",
